AmeBecomesWOKE:
CAMERA [1,6]
MusicChange(0x12)
FlashCursor(0,9,60)
TalkConvo(TimetoLeave)
SoundEffect(0x14A)
DISA_IF 0xF0
REMU 0xF0
REVEAL 0x1
LOAD1 1 AmeliaWakesUp
STAL 30
FadeBlack
SetBackground(Dungeon2)
FadeBackBlack
Text(BoatAmeliaPrologue)
FadeBlack
CLEAN
FadeBackBlack
	
	
	
	ENDA
	
